### Configure Matcha TTS model

Source: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/blob/master/sherpa-onnx/c-api/docs/tts.dox

Sets up a Matcha flow-matching TTS model with a separate vocoder (e.g., Vocos). Requires the matcha-icefall-en_US-ljspeech (English) or matcha-icefall-zh-baker (Chinese) model package.

```c
SherpaOnnxOfflineTtsConfig config;
memset(&config, 0, sizeof(config));
config.model.matcha.acoustic_model =
    "./matcha-icefall-en_US-ljspeech/model-steps-3.onnx";
config.model.matcha.vocoder = "./vocos-22khz-univ.onnx";
config.model.matcha.tokens =
    "./matcha-icefall-en_US-ljspeech/tokens.txt";
config.model.matcha.data_dir =
    "./matcha-icefall-en_US-ljspeech/espeak-ng-data";
config.model.num_threads = 2;

const SherpaOnnxOfflineTts *tts = SherpaOnnxCreateOfflineTts(&config);
```

