### Download and run Kokoro TTS (Chinese + English, async API)

Source: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/blob/master/nodejs-addon-examples/README.md

Downloads the Kokoro multi-language model and runs the async TTS test script for Chinese and English.

```bash
curl -SL -O https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/tts-models/kokoro-multi-lang-v1_0.tar.bz2
tar xf kokoro-multi-lang-v1_0.tar.bz2
rm kokoro-multi-lang-v1_0.tar.bz2

node ./test_tts_non_streaming_kokoro_zh_en_async.js
```

